      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "34c6059449cc7993",
      "translationZh": "在插件钩子的类型定义中添加了 ThemeKey 和 Color 类型，以便编辑器能够列出 mod 绘图可以命名的主题颜色",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8a3c9bcdad2df984",
      "translationZh": "在 claude plugin validate 中添加了：在网关站点注册的每个 mod 钩子都会被列出，并显示其是否具有 .catch（在 --json 下显示为 gatingHooks）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0fd7c8960c0e738f",
